      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A meteorite that landed near Richardton was named after the town, giving it a celestial namesake.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richardton%2C_North_Dakota",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "other"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s first unique feature was prefabricated houses, erected after the Northern Pacific and Richards Company platted the area in 1883.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
